Package: draco-insomnis-server
Version: @VERSION@
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: php-cli (>= 2:8.0) | php8.4-cli | php8.3-cli | php8.2-cli | php8.1-cli | php8.0-cli, php-sqlite3 | php8.4-sqlite3 | php8.3-sqlite3 | php8.2-sqlite3 | php8.1-sqlite3 | php8.0-sqlite3
Recommends: php-apcu
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Maintainer: Draco Insomnis <draco@opnv.systems>
Homepage: https://github.com/fermatacordis-create/draco-insomnis
Description: firewall in front of every PHP site on the server
 Draco Insomnis Server loads before every PHP script (auto_prepend_file) and
 gives any PHP application the Draco Insomnis firewall: SQL injection, file
 inclusion and scanner rules, a block list with ranges, a country filter, an
 anti-copy pace limit, security headers and a review request on the block
 page. Off until "draco enable"; the firewall starts in "log".
